        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin Estates Collection 5077 Bethpage Knob With R027 Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis solid forged brass knobset has old world beauty. Baldwin's Bethpage knob features a beveled edge rose that only adds to the classic allure.  It will fit a 1-3/8\" thick door with an optional backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\".\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available <a href=\"/products/bethpage-keyed-knobset-baldwin-5237\"><b>Keyed Bethpage Knobset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin Bethpage 5077 Knob With Matching R027 Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" standard door preparation.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed mounting to hide unsightly installation screws.</li>\r\n<li>Forged from solid brass for maximum strength and durability</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty latch bolts springs.</li>\r\n<li>Latches are reversible for all door conditions</li>\r\n<li>Latches include standard full lip strike</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Solid Brass Classic Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 3.262\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2.511\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2.838\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: choose either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim. </li>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button. An emergency release function allows the knob to automatically unlock when it is turned from the inside.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Bethpage Knob, Baldwin 5077",
                "description": "Baldwin Estates Collection 5077 Bethpage Knob With R027 Rosette - This solid forged brass knobset has old world beauty. Baldwin's Bethpage knob features a beveled edge rose that only adds to the classic allure.  It will fit 1-3/8 inch thick door with a 2-3/8 inch backset.",
